# Personal Intro Program

## Project Overview
A beginner-level command-line Python program that asks for the user's
name, age, and favorite hobby, then prints a friendly welcome message.

The script runs top to bottom in one pass:
1. Three `input()` calls collect name, age, and hobby as variables.
2. Three `print()` calls (one blank line, then two f-string lines)
   display the welcome message.

## Sample Output
```
What is your name? Hemant
How old are you? 23
What is your favorite hobby? Cricket

🎉 Welcome Hemant! 🎉
You are 23 years old and love Cricket.
```
